{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-32267","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-34989","text":"ADR-0005: Deployment Immutability + Active Deployment Pointer Model"}]},{"id":"blk-32268","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32270","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-34990","marks":["bold"],"text":"Status:"},{"id":"spn-34991","text":" Accepted (v1)"}]}],"id":"blk-32269","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32272","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-34992","marks":["bold"],"text":"Date:"},{"id":"spn-34993","text":" 2026-01-21"}]}],"id":"blk-32271","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32274","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-34994","marks":["bold"],"text":"Owners:"},{"id":"spn-34995","text":" webhost.systems engineering"}]}],"id":"blk-32273","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32276","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-34996","marks":["bold"],"text":"Related docs:"}]}],"id":"blk-32275","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32278","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-34997","marks":["code"],"text":"WebHost.Systems/docs/spec/00_MASTER_SPEC.md"}]}],"id":"blk-32277","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32280","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-34998","marks":["code"],"text":"WebHost.Systems/docs/spec/10_API_CONTRACTS.md"}]}],"id":"blk-32279","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32282","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-34999","marks":["code"],"text":"WebHost.Systems/docs/spec/20_RUNTIME_PROVIDER_INTERFACE.md"}]}],"id":"blk-32281","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32284","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35000","marks":["code"],"text":"WebHost.Systems/docs/spec/30_DATA_MODEL_CONVEX.md"}]}],"id":"blk-32283","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32286","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35001","marks":["code"],"text":"WebHost.Systems/docs/spec/60_TESTING_ACCEPTANCE.md"}]}],"id":"blk-32285","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32287","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35002","text":"1) Context"}]},{"id":"blk-32288","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35003","text":"webhost.systems deploys untrusted customer agent code to one of multiple runtime providers and routes invocations to the correct deployed version. The platform must support:"}]},{"id":"blk-32289","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32291","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35004","text":"safe, repeatable deployments,"}]}],"id":"blk-32290","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32293","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35005","text":"rapid iteration with reliable rollbacks,"}]}],"id":"blk-32292","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32295","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35006","text":"clear auditability (“what is running now, and who changed it?”),"}]}],"id":"blk-32294","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32297","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35007","text":"consistent routing across multiple runtime providers,"}]}],"id":"blk-32296","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32299","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35008","text":"robust handling of partial failures (deploy succeeded on provider but DB update failed; or vice versa),"}]}],"id":"blk-32298","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32301","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35009","text":"deterministic metering attribution to "},{"id":"spn-35010","marks":["code"],"text":"{userId, agentId, deploymentId, runtimeProvider}"},{"id":"spn-35011","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-32300","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32302","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35012","text":"Early prototypes often store deployment state “in place” on the agent record (e.g., overwriting "},{"id":"spn-35013","marks":["code"],"text":"workerUrl"},{"id":"spn-35014","text":", updating "},{"id":"spn-35015","marks":["code"],"text":"codeHash"},{"id":"spn-35016","text":", etc.). This tends to create correctness and support problems:"}]},{"id":"blk-32303","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32305","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35017","text":"You lose historical context (“what changed?”)."}]}],"id":"blk-32304","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32307","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35018","text":"Rollback is difficult or impossible without redeploying."}]}],"id":"blk-32306","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32309","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35019","text":"In-flight deploys can corrupt the “current” state if they fail midway."}]}],"id":"blk-32308","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32311","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35020","text":"Auditing, debugging, and cost reconciliation become fragile."}]}],"id":"blk-32310","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32313","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35021","text":"Concurrency introduces race conditions: two deploys can interleave and leave the agent in an inconsistent state."}]}],"id":"blk-32312","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32314","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35022","text":"Therefore, the system needs a durable, auditable, and concurrency-tolerant model for deployments and routing."}]},{"id":"blk-32315","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35023","text":"2) Decision"}]},{"id":"blk-32316","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35024","text":"2.1 Deployment immutability"}]},{"id":"blk-32317","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35025","text":"A "},{"id":"spn-35026","marks":["bold"],"text":"Deployment"},{"id":"spn-35027","text":" is an immutable record representing a specific released version of an agent."}]},{"id":"blk-32318","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32320","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35028","text":"A new deployment attempt MUST create a "},{"id":"spn-35029","marks":["bold"],"text":"new deployment record"},{"id":"spn-35030","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-35031","marks":["code"],"text":"deployments"},{"id":"spn-35032","text":" table row)."}]}],"id":"blk-32319","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32322","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35033","text":"Deployment records MUST be treated as immutable after creation, except for a narrowly defined mutable subset:"}]}],"id":"blk-32321","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32324","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35034","marks":["code"],"text":"status"},{"id":"spn-35035","text":" (e.g., deploying → active/failed)"}]}],"id":"blk-32323","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32326","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35036","marks":["code"],"text":"providerRef"},{"id":"spn-35037","text":" (filled once known)"}]}],"id":"blk-32325","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32328","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35038","marks":["code"],"text":"errorMessage"},{"id":"spn-35039","text":" (sanitized)"}]}],"id":"blk-32327","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32330","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35040","text":"timestamps like "},{"id":"spn-35041","marks":["code"],"text":"deployedAtMs"},{"id":"spn-35042","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-35043","marks":["code"],"text":"finishedAtMs"}]}],"id":"blk-32329","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32332","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35044","text":"optional "},{"id":"spn-35045","marks":["code"],"text":"logsRef"},{"id":"spn-35046","text":" pointer"}]}],"id":"blk-32331","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32334","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35047","text":"Any new code/artifact/provider configuration change MUST create a new deployment record (never modify an existing deployment to “become” the new version)."}]}],"id":"blk-32333","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32335","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35048","text":"2.2 Active deployment pointer"}]},{"id":"blk-32336","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35049","text":"Each agent has a single routing pointer:"}]},{"id":"blk-32337","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32339","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35050","marks":["code"],"text":"agents.activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-35051","text":" points to the deployment that should receive invocations."}]}],"id":"blk-32338","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32341","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35052","text":"Rollback (and “activate old deployment”) is implemented by updating "},{"id":"spn-35053","marks":["code"],"text":"agents.activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-35054","text":" to a previous deployment id."}]}],"id":"blk-32340","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32343","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35055","text":"Invocation routing uses ONLY:"}]}],"id":"blk-32342","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32345","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35056","text":"agent ownership checks + status checks, then"}]}],"id":"blk-32344","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32347","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35057","marks":["code"],"text":"activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-35058","text":" → "},{"id":"spn-35059","marks":["code"],"text":"deployments.providerRef"},{"id":"spn-35060","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-35061","marks":["code"],"text":"deployments.runtimeProvider"},{"id":"spn-35062","text":" to select runtime adapter and invoke."}]}],"id":"blk-32346","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32348","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35063","text":"2.3 Single-writer rule per agent during deploy (v1 simplification)"}]},{"id":"blk-32349","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35064","text":"To reduce complexity and prevent version races in v1:"}]},{"id":"blk-32350","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32352","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35065","text":"The platform MUST prevent concurrent deployments per agent (e.g., guard with "},{"id":"spn-35066","marks":["code"],"text":"agents.status=deploying"},{"id":"spn-35067","text":" or a server-side mutex mechanism)."}]}],"id":"blk-32351","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32354","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35068","text":"A second deploy attempt while "},{"id":"spn-35069","marks":["code"],"text":"deploying"},{"id":"spn-35070","text":" SHOULD fail with "},{"id":"spn-35071","marks":["code"],"text":"CONFLICT"},{"id":"spn-35072","text":" (or be queued post-v1)."}]}],"id":"blk-32353","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32355","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35073","text":"3) Rationale"}]},{"id":"blk-32356","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35074","text":"3.1 Safety and correctness"}]},{"id":"blk-32357","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35075","text":"Immutability avoids a class of “torn writes” where partial updates leave the system in an inconsistent state. If deployment artifacts and references are immutable, you can always answer:"}]},{"id":"blk-32358","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32360","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35076","text":"exactly what was deployed,"}]}],"id":"blk-32359","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32362","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35077","text":"where it was deployed,"}]}],"id":"blk-32361","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32364","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35078","text":"and when it changed."}]}],"id":"blk-32363","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32365","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35079","text":"3.2 Rollbacks become fast and reliable"}]},{"id":"blk-32366","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35080","text":"With immutable deployments, rollback is primarily a pointer change:"}]},{"id":"blk-32367","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32369","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35081","text":"no redeploy required (unless provider forces it for technical reasons),"}]}],"id":"blk-32368","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32371","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35082","text":"quick recovery from bad deploys,"}]}],"id":"blk-32370","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32373","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35083","text":"repeatable and auditable."}]}],"id":"blk-32372","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32374","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35084","text":"3.3 Auditing and supportability"}]},{"id":"blk-32375","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35085","text":"A permanent deployment history supports:"}]},{"id":"blk-32376","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32378","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35086","text":"customer support (“what changed?”),"}]}],"id":"blk-32377","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32380","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35087","text":"incident response (“who activated what?”),"}]}],"id":"blk-32379","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32382","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35088","text":"compliance-aligned audits."}]}],"id":"blk-32381","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32383","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35089","text":"3.4 Metering attribution and future cost reconciliation"}]},{"id":"blk-32384","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35090","text":"When telemetry references a "},{"id":"spn-35091","marks":["code"],"text":"deploymentId"},{"id":"spn-35092","text":" and deployments are immutable, usage can always be attributed to an exact version and provider resource set. This also enables future provider cost reconciliation by tagging provider resources per deployment."}]},{"id":"blk-32385","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35093","text":"3.5 Multi-runtime routing simplicity"}]},{"id":"blk-32386","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35094","text":"A single "},{"id":"spn-35095","marks":["code"],"text":"activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-35096","text":" model works uniformly across providers:"}]},{"id":"blk-32387","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32389","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35097","text":"Cloudflare: "},{"id":"spn-35098","marks":["code"],"text":"providerRef.cloudflare.workerUrl"},{"id":"spn-35099","text":" etc."}]}],"id":"blk-32388","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32391","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35100","text":"AgentCore: "},{"id":"spn-35101","marks":["code"],"text":"providerRef.agentcore.agentRuntimeArn"},{"id":"spn-35102","text":" etc."}]}],"id":"blk-32390","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32392","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35103","text":"The control plane remains provider-agnostic; provider-specific details are confined to adapter implementations."}]},{"id":"blk-32393","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35104","text":"4) Alternatives considered"}]},{"id":"blk-32394","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35105","text":"A) Mutable deployment state stored on the agent row only"}]},{"id":"blk-32395","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35106","marks":["bold"],"text":"Pros"}]},{"id":"blk-32396","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32398","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35107","text":"Minimal schema."}]}],"id":"blk-32397","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32400","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35108","text":"Simplifies “what’s currently active” (single record)."}]}],"id":"blk-32399","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32401","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35109","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cons"}]},{"id":"blk-32402","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32404","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35110","text":"Loses history."}]}],"id":"blk-32403","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32406","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35111","text":"Hard to rollback."}]}],"id":"blk-32405","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32408","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35112","text":"Partial failures can corrupt the running pointer."}]}],"id":"blk-32407","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32410","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35113","text":"Difficult to audit and debug."}]}],"id":"blk-32409","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32412","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35114","text":"Makes telemetry attribution ambiguous when “current deployment” changes."}]}],"id":"blk-32411","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32413","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35115","marks":["bold"],"text":"Decision:"},{"id":"spn-35116","text":" Rejected."}]},{"id":"blk-32414","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35117","text":"B) Immutable deployments without an active pointer (derive “active” from latest successful deploy)"}]},{"id":"blk-32415","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35118","marks":["bold"],"text":"Pros"}]},{"id":"blk-32416","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32418","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35119","text":"No pointer updates; “active” is last successful deployment."}]}],"id":"blk-32417","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32419","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35120","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cons"}]},{"id":"blk-32420","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32422","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35121","text":"Rollback becomes non-trivial (must “fake” a new deploy or add flags)."}]}],"id":"blk-32421","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32424","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35122","text":"“Latest” is not always what you want running (e.g., canary, manual pinning)."}]}],"id":"blk-32423","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32426","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35123","text":"In-flight deploys complicate “latest success” semantics."}]}],"id":"blk-32425","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32427","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35124","marks":["bold"],"text":"Decision:"},{"id":"spn-35125","text":" Rejected."}]},{"id":"blk-32428","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35126","text":"C) Mutable “active deployment” record plus separate immutable history"}]},{"id":"blk-32429","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35127","marks":["bold"],"text":"Pros"}]},{"id":"blk-32430","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32432","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35128","text":"A dedicated active record could simplify reads."}]}],"id":"blk-32431","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32433","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35129","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cons"}]},{"id":"blk-32434","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32436","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35130","text":"You now have two sources of truth to keep consistent."}]}],"id":"blk-32435","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32438","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35131","text":"Reintroduces mutability issues for the “active” record."}]}],"id":"blk-32437","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32440","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35132","text":"Added complexity with limited benefit over a pointer."}]}],"id":"blk-32439","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32441","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35133","marks":["bold"],"text":"Decision:"},{"id":"spn-35134","text":" Rejected."}]},{"id":"blk-32442","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35135","text":"D) Blue/green or canary routing model as default"}]},{"id":"blk-32443","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35136","marks":["bold"],"text":"Pros"}]},{"id":"blk-32444","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32446","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35137","text":"Advanced rollout safety."}]}],"id":"blk-32445","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32447","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35138","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cons"}]},{"id":"blk-32448","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32450","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35139","text":"Too complex for v1."}]}],"id":"blk-32449","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32452","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35140","text":"Requires traffic splitting, per-request routing policies, and richer metrics gating."}]}],"id":"blk-32451","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32454","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35141","text":"Still requires immutable deployments underneath."}]}],"id":"blk-32453","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32455","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35142","marks":["bold"],"text":"Decision:"},{"id":"spn-35143","text":" Deferred to post-v1; can be built on top of this ADR."}]},{"id":"blk-32456","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35144","text":"5) Consequences"}]},{"id":"blk-32457","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35145","text":"5.1 Positive consequences"}]},{"id":"blk-32458","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32460","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35146","text":"Reliable rollback (pointer flip)."}]}],"id":"blk-32459","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32462","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35147","text":"Clear deployment audit trail."}]}],"id":"blk-32461","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32464","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35148","text":"Strong basis for incident response and debugging."}]}],"id":"blk-32463","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32466","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35149","text":"Simplified multi-runtime invocation routing."}]}],"id":"blk-32465","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32468","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35150","text":"Enables deterministic telemetry attribution and later cost reconciliation."}]}],"id":"blk-32467","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32469","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35151","text":"5.2 Negative consequences / tradeoffs"}]},{"id":"blk-32470","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32472","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35152","text":"More schema and records (deployments grow over time)."}]}],"id":"blk-32471","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32474","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35153","text":"Requires retention policy decisions for old deployments (storage cleanup, provider resource deprovisioning)."}]}],"id":"blk-32473","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32476","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35154","text":"Requires careful handling of “deploy succeeded but DB update failed” and vice versa."}]}],"id":"blk-32475","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32478","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35155","text":"Requires a versioning strategy (monotonic per agent) and concurrency controls."}]}],"id":"blk-32477","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32479","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35156","text":"6) Implementation details (normative requirements)"}]},{"id":"blk-32480","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35157","text":"6.1 Data model requirements"}]},{"id":"blk-32481","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35158","text":"The following fields/semantics MUST exist (names may vary if consistent):"}]},{"id":"blk-32482","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32484","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35159","marks":["code"],"text":"deployments"},{"id":"spn-35160","text":" table with:"}]}],"id":"blk-32483","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32486","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35161","marks":["code"],"text":"agentId"},{"id":"spn-35162","text":", "},{"id":"spn-35163","marks":["code"],"text":"userId"}]}],"id":"blk-32485","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32488","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35164","marks":["code"],"text":"version"},{"id":"spn-35165","text":" (monotonic per agent)"}]}],"id":"blk-32487","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32490","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35166","marks":["code"],"text":"runtimeProvider"}]}],"id":"blk-32489","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32492","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35167","marks":["code"],"text":"artifact"},{"id":"spn-35168","text":" reference (uploaded bundle or repo ref)"}]}],"id":"blk-32491","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32494","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35169","marks":["code"],"text":"providerRef"},{"id":"spn-35170","text":" (runtime-specific invoke reference)"}]}],"id":"blk-32493","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32496","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35171","marks":["code"],"text":"status"},{"id":"spn-35172","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-35173","marks":["code"],"text":"errorMessage"}]}],"id":"blk-32495","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32498","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35174","text":"timestamps ("},{"id":"spn-35175","marks":["code"],"text":"createdAtMs"},{"id":"spn-35176","text":", "},{"id":"spn-35177","marks":["code"],"text":"deployedAtMs"},{"id":"spn-35178","text":", "},{"id":"spn-35179","marks":["code"],"text":"finishedAtMs"},{"id":"spn-35180","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-32497","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32500","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35181","marks":["code"],"text":"agents.activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-35182","text":" pointer to "},{"id":"spn-35183","marks":["code"],"text":"deployments._id"},{"id":"spn-35184","text":" (nullable)"}]}],"id":"blk-32499","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32501","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35185","text":"6.2 Immutability enforcement"}]},{"id":"blk-32502","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32504","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35186","text":"Server code MUST NOT update artifact identity fields on "},{"id":"spn-35187","marks":["code"],"text":"deployments"},{"id":"spn-35188","text":" after creation:"}]}],"id":"blk-32503","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32506","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35189","marks":["code"],"text":"artifact.*"},{"id":"spn-35190","text":", "},{"id":"spn-35191","marks":["code"],"text":"manifest.*"},{"id":"spn-35192","text":", "},{"id":"spn-35193","marks":["code"],"text":"runtimeProvider"},{"id":"spn-35194","text":", "},{"id":"spn-35195","marks":["code"],"text":"version"}]}],"id":"blk-32505","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32508","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35196","text":"Only the allowed mutable subset may be updated (status/providerRef/error/timestamps/log pointers)."}]}],"id":"blk-32507","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32510","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35197","text":"Client code MUST NOT be allowed to update deployment rows directly."}]}],"id":"blk-32509","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32511","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35198","text":"6.3 Activation rules"}]},{"id":"blk-32512","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35199","text":"When activating a deployment (including rollback):"}]},{"id":"blk-32513","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32515","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35200","text":"The target deployment MUST:"}]}],"id":"blk-32514","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32517","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35201","text":"belong to the agent,"}]}],"id":"blk-32516","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32519","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35202","text":"belong to the current user (tenant check),"}]}],"id":"blk-32518","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32521","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35203","text":"be in a valid state for activation (recommended: "},{"id":"spn-35204","marks":["code"],"text":"status=active"},{"id":"spn-35205","text":")."}]}],"id":"blk-32520","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32523","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35206","text":"The system MUST update "},{"id":"spn-35207","marks":["code"],"text":"agents.activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-35208","text":" to the target deployment id."}]}],"id":"blk-32522","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32525","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35209","text":"The system SHOULD record an audit log entry:"}]}],"id":"blk-32524","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32527","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35210","marks":["code"],"text":"deployment.activate"},{"id":"spn-35211","text":" with "},{"id":"spn-35212","marks":["code"],"text":"{agentId, deploymentId}"},{"id":"spn-35213","text":" and optional reason."}]}],"id":"blk-32526","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32528","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35214","text":"6.4 Routing rules"}]},{"id":"blk-32529","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35215","text":"The invocation gateway MUST route using: 1. resolve agent and enforce ownership (unless public agents exist post-v1), 2. verify agent is not "},{"id":"spn-35216","marks":["code"],"text":"disabled"},{"id":"spn-35217","text":"/deleted, 3. read "},{"id":"spn-35218","marks":["code"],"text":"activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-35219","text":", 4. load deployment by id and verify it belongs to agent and user, 5. route via runtime adapter selected by "},{"id":"spn-35220","marks":["code"],"text":"deployment.runtimeProvider"},{"id":"spn-35221","text":", 6. invoke using "},{"id":"spn-35222","marks":["code"],"text":"deployment.providerRef"},{"id":"spn-35223","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-32530","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35224","text":"Routing MUST NOT use “latest deployment” heuristics."}]},{"id":"blk-32531","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35225","text":"6.5 Deploy flow atomicity and failure handling"}]},{"id":"blk-32532","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35226","text":"A deployment flow typically spans multiple systems (DB + provider). The platform MUST handle partial failures."}]},{"id":"blk-32533","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35227","text":"Minimum v1 requirement:"}]},{"id":"blk-32534","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32536","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35228","text":"The system MUST persist a deployment row with "},{"id":"spn-35229","marks":["code"],"text":"status=deploying"},{"id":"spn-35230","text":" before making provider calls."}]}],"id":"blk-32535","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32538","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35231","text":"If provider deployment fails:"}]}],"id":"blk-32537","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32540","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35232","text":"set deployment "},{"id":"spn-35233","marks":["code"],"text":"status=failed"},{"id":"spn-35234","text":" and store sanitized "},{"id":"spn-35235","marks":["code"],"text":"errorMessage"},{"id":"spn-35236","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-32539","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32542","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35237","text":"set agent "},{"id":"spn-35238","marks":["code"],"text":"status=error"},{"id":"spn-35239","text":" (or keep existing status but expose failure)."}]}],"id":"blk-32541","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32544","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35240","text":"If provider deployment succeeds but DB update fails:"}]}],"id":"blk-32543","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32546","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35241","text":"the system MUST have a retry mechanism (manual or automated) to reconcile:"}]}],"id":"blk-32545","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32548","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35242","text":"either re-run the “finalize deploy” step idempotently, or"}]}],"id":"blk-32547","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32550","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35243","text":"detect orphaned provider resources via tags and mark deployment active later."}]}],"id":"blk-32549","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32552","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35244","text":"If DB update succeeds but provider deployment later fails (rare but possible due to eventual consistency):"}]}],"id":"blk-32551","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32554","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35245","text":"system must reconcile on next healthcheck/invoke attempt and mark deployment failed if unusable."}]}],"id":"blk-32553","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32555","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35246","text":"6.6 Provider resource tagging (required for cleanup and reconciliation)"}]},{"id":"blk-32556","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35247","text":"All provider resources created for a deployment MUST be tagged/labelled with:"}]},{"id":"blk-32557","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32559","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35248","marks":["code"],"text":"userId"}]}],"id":"blk-32558","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32561","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35249","marks":["code"],"text":"agentId"}]}],"id":"blk-32560","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32563","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35250","marks":["code"],"text":"deploymentId"}]}],"id":"blk-32562","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32565","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35251","marks":["code"],"text":"deploymentVersion"}]}],"id":"blk-32564","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32567","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35252","marks":["code"],"text":"runtimeProvider"}]}],"id":"blk-32566","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32568","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35253","text":"6.7 Retention and cleanup"}]},{"id":"blk-32569","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32571","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35254","text":"Deployments are retained as part of audit history."}]}],"id":"blk-32570","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32573","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35255","text":"The platform SHOULD implement:"}]}],"id":"blk-32572","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32575","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35256","text":"retention policy for old deployments (e.g., keep last N or last X days) per tier,"}]}],"id":"blk-32574","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32577","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35257","text":"best-effort deprovisioning of provider resources when deployments are deleted or when an agent is deleted."}]}],"id":"blk-32576","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32579","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35258","text":"Cleanup MUST be careful not to remove resources for the currently active deployment."}]}],"id":"blk-32578","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32580","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35259","text":"7) Testing requirements (acceptance-focused)"}]},{"id":"blk-32581","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35260","text":"7.1 Unit tests (MUST)"}]},{"id":"blk-32582","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32584","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35261","text":"Deployment status transition validation."}]}],"id":"blk-32583","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32586","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35262","text":"Immutability enforcement (attempted mutation of immutable fields rejected)."}]}],"id":"blk-32585","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32588","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35263","text":"Activation validation (wrong agent/user/state rejected)."}]}],"id":"blk-32587","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32590","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35264","text":"Routing resolver uses "},{"id":"spn-35265","marks":["code"],"text":"activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-35266","text":" only."}]}],"id":"blk-32589","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32591","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35267","text":"7.2 Integration tests (MUST)"}]},{"id":"blk-32592","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32594","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35268","text":"Deploy creates new immutable record; a second deploy creates a second record."}]}],"id":"blk-32593","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32596","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35269","text":"Activate (rollback) changes routing immediately."}]}],"id":"blk-32595","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32598","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35270","text":"Concurrent deploy attempts are rejected with "},{"id":"spn-35271","marks":["code"],"text":"CONFLICT"},{"id":"spn-35272","text":" (v1)."}]}],"id":"blk-32597","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32600","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35273","text":"Telemetry attribution includes correct "},{"id":"spn-35274","marks":["code"],"text":"deploymentId"},{"id":"spn-35275","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-32599","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32601","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35276","text":"7.3 E2E tests (MUST)"}]},{"id":"blk-32602","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32604","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35277","text":"Deploy v1 → invoke returns v1 output."}]}],"id":"blk-32603","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32606","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35278","text":"Deploy v2 → invoke returns v2 output."}]}],"id":"blk-32605","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32608","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35279","text":"Activate v1 → invoke returns v1 output again."}]}],"id":"blk-32607","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32610","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35280","text":"Deployment history remains intact and visible."}]}],"id":"blk-32609","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32611","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35281","text":"8) Future extensions enabled by this ADR"}]},{"id":"blk-32612","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35282","text":"This model is a foundation for:"}]},{"id":"blk-32613","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32615","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35283","text":"canary/blue-green deployments (multiple “active” pointers with traffic split policies),"}]}],"id":"blk-32614","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32617","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35284","text":"environment promotion (dev → staging → prod) with deployment immutability preserved,"}]}],"id":"blk-32616","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32619","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35285","text":"signed deployment manifests / provenance,"}]}],"id":"blk-32618","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32621","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35286","text":"provider billing reconciliation (resource tags + immutable providerRef),"}]}],"id":"blk-32620","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32623","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35287","text":"more advanced rollback policies (automatic rollback on error rate thresholds)."}]}],"id":"blk-32622","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32624","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35288","text":"9) Acceptance criteria"}]},{"id":"blk-32625","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35289","text":"This ADR is correctly implemented when: 1. Every deployment attempt creates a new deployment record and does not mutate previous deployments’ immutable fields. 2. An agent’s invocations always route to "},{"id":"spn-35290","marks":["code"],"text":"activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-35291","text":" (no “latest deploy” routing). 3. Rollback is implemented as an activation/pointer update and takes effect immediately for new invocations. 4. Deployment status transitions are correct and failures do not corrupt the active deployment pointer. 5. Provider resources are tagged with "},{"id":"spn-35292","marks":["code"],"text":"{userId, agentId, deploymentId}"},{"id":"spn-35293","text":". 6. E2E tests demonstrate deploy v1 → deploy v2 → rollback to v1 with correct outputs and preserved history."}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierauvhmpykjjlbsrrjhh7kq6dxebah5cfsppf3r5mxi54qjdcv6vmjq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}